# The bim module's part of the evaluation: the candidates a recheck of the
# whole model examines besides the elements the other modules own: the levels.
import bim/bim_model.dl

function collect bim candidates of {bim model record:modelValue} with bim elements into {a pointer to a list:candidates}:
    execute:
        loop cursor from 0 to the length of (modelValue's levels's values):
            append (the item at cursor in (modelValue's levels's values))'s id to candidates
